* C18 a_n6_5# Gnd 0.02fF
* C19 a_26_n17# Gnd 0.14fF
* C20 a_6_n17# Gnd 0.15fF
* C21 inputb Gnd 0.13fF
* C22 inputa Gnd 0.12fF
* C23 vdd Gnd 2.69fF

* .tran 1p 300n

* .control
* run
* plot v(inputa) v(inputb)+2 v(out)+4
